    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWelcome to No. 160 The Park - a wonderful 4 bed semi-detached home located in this popular residential development, walking distance of the bustling town of Naas to include; schools, shops, supermarkets, stylish boutiques, bars, restaurants, health, leisure and public transport facilities.\n\nAccommodation briefly comprises of; entrance hall, guest w.c., living room, kitchen/dining room, , 4 bedrooms, en-suite and main family bathroom.\n\nOutside are spacious front and rear gardens with ample off street parking in the driveway. The rear south east garden is fully walled with timber shed. \n\nThe Arrow train station in Sallins and the N7 motorway are also just a few moments away, making commuting to and from Dublin hassle free.\n\nDon't miss the opportunity to view this wonderful family home in Naas."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.891m x 1.988m\nWelcoming and bright hallway with understairs storage.\n\n. - \n\n\nGuest wc. - \nTiled floor & splash back, w.c., and w.h.b & mirror.\n\n. - \n\n\nLiving Room - 5.410 x 3.402\nWith feature marble open fireplace, wood flooring, coving, centre rose & dado rail.\n\n. - \n\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 5.376 x 5.392\nA large bright room with ample storage space for cooking & entertaing. Velux window for natutal light.Kitchen: Maple shaker style kitchen units, tiled floor & splash back, plumbed for washing machine & dishwasher, stainless steel sink. Dining Area: Semi solid wood flooring, window to the side.\n\n. - \n\n\nUtilty Room - 2.345 x 1.886\nDoor to side of the property, velux window, wood flooring & gas boiler.\n\n. - \n\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.257 x 3.804\nLocated on the ground floor this large double room benifits french doors to the rear garden & side window.\n\nEnsuite - \nA fully tiled wet room, w.h.b, w.c. & window.\n\n. - \n\n\nLanding - \nHot press and dual immersion. Access to attic.\n\n. - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.814 x 3.709\nA double facing to the front with built in wardrobes.\n\n. - \n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.562 x 3.621\nA double facing the rear with built in wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite - \nTiled floor & shower unit, electric shower, w.h.b., w.c.\n\n. - \n\n\nBathroom - \nA fully fitted bathroom , bath with shower screen, w.c., w.h.b. & window.\n\n. - \n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.497 x 2.636\nA spacious single to the front of the property\n\n. - \n\n\nOUTSIDE - \nRear Garden - Fully walled garden private in aspect, barna shed & mature trees.Front Garden - walled front garden, laid to lawn with mature shrubs & trees. Ample parking for 3 cars & side gate.\n\n. - \n\n\nDisclaimer: - \nThe above are issued by DNG Doyle Naas on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars which are issued for guidance purposes only and neither the form nor the agent holds themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. The purchaser is advised to make their own arrangements to satisfy themselves with measurements, details and contents include\n\n"
      },
